# Global Constraints

## Design
- Match screenshots exactly. Mobile-first: fix any mobile issues found (font sizes, layout breaks, color mismatches).
- Assets: every image and video must be uploadable via the Shopify theme editor. Use visible labeled placeholders where no asset is provided.
- Icons: build as inline SVG, matching the design screenshots.

## Code quality
- `assets/lp-design-system.css` is the only source for visual values. No hardcoded colors, sizes, or spacing anywhere.
- BEM naming for all CSS, scoped per section (e.g. `.lp-hero__title`, `.lp-hero__title--highlighted`).
- Every section is fully self-contained. No cross-section CSS dependencies.
- No inline styles.
- All copy and visual content editable via schema. No hardcoded text in Liquid.
- Schema settings must cover every value a merchant might realistically want to change.

## What to preserve
- All business logic in `sections/hps-offerta.liquid` (shoe + t-shirt + combined discounts). Style updates only.
- `sections/lp-reviews.liquid` entirely. Do not open, read, or modify it.
